<report>
<title>Two independent proportions</title>
<p>Total 1 = <in>n_1</in>,  response 1 = <in>r_1</in><br />
Proportion 1 = <inu>prop_1</inu><br />
Total 2 = <in>n_2</in>,  response 2 = <in>r_2</in><br />
Proportion 2 = <inu>prop_2</inu></p>

<p>Proportion difference = <inu>prop_diff</inu></p>

<p><ci>Approximate (Miettinen) <in>ci</in>% confidence interval = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci></p>
<block name="exact2">

<p><pval>Exact two sided (mid) <inp>mp</inp></pval></p>
</block>

<p>Standard error of proportion difference = <inu>se</inu><br />
Standard normal deviate (z) = <inu>z</inu></p>
<block name="approx2">
<p><pval>Approximate two sided <inp>p_2</inp></pval><br />
<pval>Approximate one sided <inp>p_1</inp></pval></p>
</block>
</report>
